# Runbook — integration subsystem gate blocked

```yaml
runbook_version: "2026-06-29-v1"
map_ref: docs/dev/system-consistency-guard.mdoc
implementation:
  - apps/api/src/health/integration-subsystem-gate.ts
  - apps/api/src/health/migration-consistency-check.ts
  - apps/api/src/integrations/http/integrations.service.ts
```

## Symptoms

- `POST/PATCH/DELETE` on integrations returns **503** or subsystem-not-ready error.
- Operator can **read** integration list/detail but cannot connect Telegram or save exposure.
- Boot log: `integration_subsystem_gate` not ready / consistency report `ok: false`.

## Root causes

| Cause | Tables / signal | Fix |
| ----- | --------------- | --- |
| Integration migrations not applied | Missing `integration_connections`, `integration_event_policies`, … | `pnpm --filter @apps/api run db:migrate:deploy` |
| Exposure tables missing (9.1b fatal) | `exposure_intents`, `exposure_profiles`, `denali_exposure_reminder_activations` | Apply exposure migrations; set `FIELD_EXPOSURE_CONSISTENCY_GATE_FATAL=false` temporarily only in dev |
| Prisma client stale | Schema drift after migrate | `prisma generate` + API restart (see `docs/phase-5/appendices/migrate-deploy-only.md`) |
| `STORAGE_DRIVER=memory` in prod | Gate may never arm | Use `STORAGE_DRIVER=prisma` with `DATABASE_URL` |

## Triage steps

1. Hit `GET /health` — inspect consistency subsection if exposed.
2. Run migration deploy against the target database.
3. Verify required tables exist (integration + exposure lists in `migration-consistency-check.ts`).
4. Restart API process after `prisma generate`.
5. Re-test `PATCH /integrations/:id/exposure-intents/:eventType` with admin session.

## Warn-only vs fatal (exposure tables)

| Mode | Env | Effect |
| ---- | --- | ------ |
| Warn (default) | `FIELD_EXPOSURE_CONSISTENCY_GATE_FATAL` unset/false | Log `CONSISTENCY_MISSING_EXPOSURE_TABLES`; reads degraded with banners |
| Fatal (staging+) | `FIELD_EXPOSURE_CONSISTENCY_GATE_FATAL=true` | Blocks integration **mutations** until tables present |

## Degraded read (not a gate block)

`GET /integrations/:id` may return `loadWarnings: ["POLICIES_UNAVAILABLE"]` or `EXPOSURE_INTENTS_UNAVAILABLE` while gate is open — UI shows banner; this is **not** the same as mutation block.
